{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Congratulations, Operator #8</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been randomly selected for the ITER Corporation\u2019s exciting vertical ventures department. Drill the pillars that encircle our homeworld, extract essential resources, and try not to get obliterated in the process. If you fail, don\u2019t worry,\u00a0 your replacement will be along shortly - probably with a better attitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; Mining 101</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832310/extras/6a835b6bb6a4307d1d1d11042e988bf6.poster.avif?t=1761666834\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832310/extras/6a835b6bb6a4307d1d1d11042e988bf6.webm?t=1761666834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832310/extras/6a835b6bb6a4307d1d1d11042e988bf6.mp4?t=1761666834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crack open the Pillars like a big happy management-mandated breakroom pi\u00f1ata. Inside you\u2019ll find valuable minerals and definitely no workplace hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt;\u00a0Defend Company Property! (With Your Life, Please)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832310/extras/2ad950ad21bf6ce17e460402053f24af.poster.avif?t=1761666834\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832310/extras/2ad950ad21bf6ce17e460402053f24af.webm?t=1761666834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832310/extras/2ad950ad21bf6ce17e460402053f24af.mp4?t=1761666834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Company needs you, your hand eye coordination, and your bullets. Take control of the gun tower and build automated turrets to fend off waves of potential threats on the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; Upgrades, People! Upgrades!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832310/extras/06b4abd46df48bed15de082606e61229.poster.avif?t=1761666834\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832310/extras/06b4abd46df48bed15de082606e61229.webm?t=1761666834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832310/extras/06b4abd46df48bed15de082606e61229.mp4?t=1761666834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ITER puts self-improvement first. Mine faster, shoot harder, or slap some duct tape on that gear in the name of \u201cR&amp;D.\u201d Your career growth is in your hands (until they\u2019re vaporised).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; End of Life Policy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832310/extras/f58bed321ea83b348a2051aaeadc9ec1.poster.avif?t=1761666834\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832310/extras/f58bed321ea83b348a2051aaeadc9ec1.webm?t=1761666834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832310/extras/f58bed321ea83b348a2051aaeadc9ec1.mp4?t=1761666834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are grateful for your continued commitment to ITER. Your inevitable replacement will pick up where you left off and may even bring new skills\u2026 Remember, in space, no one can hear you scream - <strong>and to do so is a waste of valuable company time</strong> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2832310?t=1761666834","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832310/0987ac408e128f713da627b5292727d075afc293/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761666834","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832310/6d92de55ba0d9286bca0302faa3544af76f9fd71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761666834","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832310/6d92de55ba0d9286bca0302faa3544af76f9fd71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761666834","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3936690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Also Announced at ONL</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Congratulations, Operator #8</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been randomly selected for the ITER Corporation\u2019s exciting vertical ventures department. Drill the pillars that encircle our homeworld, extract essential resources, and try not to get obliterated in the process. If you fail, don\u2019t worry,\u00a0 your replacement will be along shortly - probably with a better attitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; Mining 101</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragrap